"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:53
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot write boot menu timeout:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
