"ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນເວລາລໍຖ້າຂອງເມນູບູດ:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:65
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot read boot menu timeout:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານເວລາລໍຖ້າຂອງເມນູບູດ:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#. -1 will be returned from sdbootutil for menu-force
#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:87
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot write default boot menu entry:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນລາຍການເມນູບູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:100
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot read default menu:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານເມນູເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#. Password used by sdbootutil as a TPM2 PIN
#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:144
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot enroll authentication:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#. rubocop:enable Metrics/AbcSize
#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:161
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot Cannot create machine-id:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ machine-id:\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:172
msgid "Cannot pass empty password via the keyring."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງລະຫັດຜ່ານຫວ່າງເປົ່າຜ່ານພວງກະແຈ (keyring) ໄດ້."

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:182
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cannot pass the password via the keyring:\n"
"Command `%{command}`.\n"
"Error output: %{stderr}"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງລະຫັດຜ່ານຜ່ານພວງກະແຈ (keyring):\n"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ `%{command}`.\n"
"ຜົນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ: %{stderr}"

#: src/lib/bootloader/bls.rb:193
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Please ensure that a FIDO2 Key is connected to your system in order to "
"enroll the authentication for device %{device}.\n"
"You will be asked to push the FIDO2 key button twice for transfering the "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກະແຈ FIDO2 ກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັ"
"ບອຸປະກອນ %{device}.\n"
"ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມເທິງກະແຈ FIDO2 ສອງຄັ້ງເພື່ອສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

