#. no location chosen, so warn user that it is problem unless he is sure
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2.rb:314
msgid ""
"Warning: No location for boot code selected.Unless you know what you are "
"doing please select above location."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳເຕືອນ: ບໍ່ມີການເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງສຳລັບລະຫັດບູດ. ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານຈະຮູ້ສິ່ງທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດ, ກະລຸນາເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງຂ້າງ"
"ເທິງ."

#. TRANSLATORS: title for list of location proposals
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2.rb:322
#, c-format
msgid "Boot Code: %s"
msgstr "ລະຫັດບູດ: %s"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:64
msgid ""
"<p><b>Timeout in Seconds</b>\n"
"specifies the time the boot loader will wait until the default kernel is "
"loaded.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ກຳນົດເວລາເ ປັນວິນາທີ</b>\n"
"ລະບຸເວລາ ທີ່ຕົວໂຫຼດການບູດ ຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າເຄີເນີລເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນມາ.</p>\n"

#. Represents decision if bootloader need activated partition
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:100
msgid "Set &active Flag in Partition Table for Boot Partition"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຟລັກ &active ໃນຕາຕະລາງພາກສ່ວນ (Partition Table) ສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນບູດ"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:104
msgid ""
"<p><b>Set Active Flag in Partition Table for Boot Partition</b>\n"
"specifies whether the partition containing the boot loader will have the "
"\"active\" flag. The generic MBR code will then\n"
"boot the active partition. Older BIOSes require one partition to be active "
"even\n"
"if the boot loader is installed in the MBR.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຕັ້ງແຟລັກ Active ໃນຕາຕະລາງພາກສ່ວນສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນບູດ</b>\n"
"ກຳນົດວ່າພາກສ່ວນທີ່ມີບູດໂຫລດເດີຈະມີແຟລັກ \"active\" ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຈາກນັ້ນລະຫັດ MBR ທົ່ວໄປຈະ\n"
"ບູດຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີ່ active. BIOS ລຸ້ນເກົ່າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີໜຶ່ງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ active ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ\n"
"ບູດໂຫລດເດີຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ MBR ກໍຕາມ.</p>"

#. Represents decision if generic MBR have to be installed on disk
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:134
msgid "Write &generic Boot Code to MBR"
msgstr "ຂຽນລະຫັດບູດ &ທົ່ວໄປ (generic) ລົງໃນ MBR"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:138
msgid ""
"<p><b>Write generic Boot Code to MBR</b> replace the master boot record of "
"your disk with generic code (OS independent code which\n"
"boots the active partition).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຂຽນລະຫັດບູດທົ່ວໄປລົງໃນ MBR</b> ປ່ຽນແທນ master boot record ຂອງດິສກ໌ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍລະຫັດ"
"ທົ່ວໄປ (ລະຫັດທີ່ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ເຊິ່ງຈະ\n"
"ບູດພາກສ່ວນທີ່ active).</p>"

#. Represents decision if menu should be hidden or visible
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:165
msgid "&Hide Menu on Boot"
msgstr "&ເຊື່ອງເມນູຕອນບູດ"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:169
msgid "<p>Selecting <b>Hide Menu on Boot</b> will hide the boot menu.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ການເລືອກ <b>ເຊື່ອງເມນູຕອນບູດ</b> ຈະເປັນການເຊື່ອງເມນູບູດ.</p>"

#. Represents if os prober should be run
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:190
msgid "Pro&be Foreign OS"
msgstr "ກວດສອບ &ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນ (Foreign OS)"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:194
msgid ""
"<p><b>Probe Foreign OS</b> by means of os-prober for multiboot with other "
"foreign distribution </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ກວດສອບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນ</b> ໂດຍໃຊ້ os-prober ສຳລັບການເຮັດ multiboot ກັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັ"
"ນອື່ນ </p>"

#. Represents switcher for Trusted Boot
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:220
msgid "&Trusted Boot Support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ &Trusted Boot"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:224
msgid ""
"<p><b>Trusted Boot</b> means measuring the integrity of the boot process,\n"
"with the help from the hardware (a TPM, Trusted Platform Module,\n"
"chip).\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Trusted Boot</b> ໝາຍເຖິງການວັດແທກຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂະບວນການບູດ,\n"
"ໂດຍໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຮາດແວ (TPM, Trusted Platform Module,\n"
"ຊິບ).\n"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:229
msgid ""
"First you need to make sure Trusted Boot is enabled in the BIOS\n"
"setup (the setting may be named \"Security Chip\", for example).\n"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນອື່ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ Trusted Boot ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ BIOS\n"
"(ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອາດຈະມີຊື່ວ່າ \"Security Chip\", ເປັນຕົ້ນ).\n"

#. check for file size does not work, since FS reports it 4096
#. even if the file is in fact empty and a single byte cannot
#. be read, therefore testing real reading (details: bsc#994556)
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:258
msgid ""
"Trusted Platform Module not found.\n"
"Make sure it is enabled in BIOS.\n"
"The system will not boot otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບ Trusted Platform Module.\n"
"ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ BIOS ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ລະບົບຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບູດໄດ້."

#. Represents grub password protection widget
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:280
msgid "Prot&ect Boot Loader with Password"
msgstr "&ປົກປ້ອງບູດໂຫລດເດີດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. TRANSLATORS: checkbox entry
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:286
msgid "P&rotect Entry Modification Only"
msgstr "ປົກປ້ອງສະເພາະການແກ້ໄຂ&ລາຍການເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#. TRANSLATORS: text entry, please keep it short
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:292
msgid "&Password for GRUB2 User 'root'"
msgstr "&ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ GRUB2 'root'"

#. text entry
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:295
msgid "Re&type Password"
msgstr "ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານ&ຄືນໃໝ່"

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:307
msgid "The password must not be empty."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:315
msgid ""
"'Password' and 'Retype password'\n"
"do not match. Retype the password."
msgstr ""
"'ລະຫັດຜ່ານ' ແລະ 'ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານຄືນໃໝ່'\n"
"ບໍ່ກົງກັນ. ກະລຸນາພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານຄືນໃໝ່."

#. special value as we do not know password, so it mean user do not change it
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:368
msgid ""
"<p><b>Protect Boot Loader with Password</b>\n"
"at boot time, modifying or even booting any entry will require the password. "
"If <b>Protect Entry Modification Only</b> is checked then booting any entry "
"is not restricted but modifying entries requires the password (which is the "
"way GRUB 1 behaved). As side-effect of this option, rd.shell=0 is added to "
"kernel parameters, to prevent an unauthorized access to the initrd shell. "
"YaST will only accept the password if you repeat it in <b>Retype Password</"
"b>. The password applies to the GRUB2 user 'root' which is distinct from the "
"Linux 'root'. YaST currently does not support other GRUB2 users. If you need "
"them, use a separate GRUB2 script.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ປົກປ້ອງໂຕໂຫຼດບູດດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>\n"
"ໃນເວລາບູດ, ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ການບູດລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ <b>ປົກປ້ອງສ"
"ະເພາະການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການ</b>, ການບູດລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແຕ່ການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດ"
"ຜ່ານ (ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີທີ່ GRUB 1 ເຄີຍເຮັດ). ເປັນຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງຂອງຕົວເລືອກນີ້, rd.shell=0 ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ"
"ພະລາມິເຕີຂອງເຄີເນິລ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ initrd shell ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. YaST ຈະຍອມຮັບລະ"
"ຫັດຜ່ານກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຄືນໃໝ່ໃນ <b>ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຄືນອີກຄັ້ງ</b>. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"'root' ຂອງ GRUB2 ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ 'root' ຂອງ Linux. ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ YaST ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"GRUB2 ຄົນອື່ນໆ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ພວກເຂົາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ GRUB2 ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ.</p>"

#. Translators: do not translate the quoted parts like "unit"
#: src/lib/bootloader/grub2_widgets.rb:410
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>Graphical console</b> when checked it allows to use various display "
"resolutions. The <tt>auto</tt> option tries to find the best one when "
"booting starts.</p>\n"
"<p><b>Serial console</b> when checked it redirects the boot output to a "
"serial device like <tt>ttyS0</tt>. At least the <tt>--unit</tt> option has "
"to be specified, and the complete syntax is <tt>%s</tt>. Other parts are "
"optional and if not set, a default is used. <tt>NUM</tt> in commands stands "
"for a positive number like 8. Example parameters are <tt>serial --"
"speed=38400 --unit=0</tt>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຄອນໂຊນແບບກຣາຟິກ</b> ເມື່ອເລືອກຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ຕົວເລືອກ <tt>"
"auto</tt> ຈະພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.</p>\n"
"<p><b>ຄອນໂຊນແບບຊີຣຽວ</b> ເມື່ອເລືອກຈະສົ່ງຜົນການບູດໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນຊີຣຽວເຊັ່ນ <tt>ttyS0</tt>. ຕ້"
"ອງມີການລະບຸຕົວເລືອກ <tt>--unit</tt> ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຢ່າງ, ແລະ ໄວຍາກອນທີ່ສົມບູນແມ່ນ <tt>%s</tt>"
". <tt>NUM</tt> ໝາຍເຖິງຕົວເລກ. ຕົວຢ່າງພາລາມີເຕີແມ່ນ <tt>serial --speed=38400 --"
"unit=0</tt>.</p>"

